8k-2 &= 10p.
\end{align*}

Rearranging these, we get:
\begin{align*}
8k-9m &= 1, \tag{1} \\
8k-10p &= 2. \tag{2}
\end{align*}

From equation (2), we can simplify to:
\begin{align*}
4k-5p &= 1. \tag{3}
\end{align*}

